315) 792-3409 Email cebonave@utica.edu Department Type Administrative Office Location 120 White Hall Hours Monday-Friday, 8:30 a.m. to 5:00 p.m. More In This Section Click to expose navigation links on mobile. Center For Career Readiness Overview of Services Students #UCMySuccess Employers Faculty and Staff Alumni Additional Resources Our Staff Career Mentor Program The time to start planning for tomorrow is today. Let us help. Our Mission The mission of the Jeremy C. Thurston ’00 Center for Career Readiness is to provide services and resources that enhance and support students’ career development and graduate school readiness, preparing them for successful post-graduation careers. Career Management System Schedule a Major/Career Exploration Appointment through Handshake . Handshake is The Center’s career management system and is designed to create connections between students/alumni, employers, and The Center’s staff. Features include job and internship postings, event and workshop registrations, and the ability to schedule an appointment with The Center’s Career Coaching Program staff. Account Login: Student Login New Employers ( Employers: Please read our posting policy ) Questions? Contact the Center or visit the Handshake Help Guide . QUICK LINKS: Resources and Guides Meet the Staff Micro-Internships with Parker Dewey Request a Class Presentation Follow us on Instagram Internships and Careers Akemi Reyes '20 Cybersecurity Microsoft 365 Specialist at ZONES, Inc. (job) Madison Judge '21 Public Relations Marketing Intern at Total Solutions More #UCMySuccess Stories Close Window I would like to see logins and resources for: Which audience would you like to see logins and resources for? Current Undergraduate Students Current Graduate Students Current Online Students Admitted Students Parents and Families Faculty Staff Submit For a general list of frequently used logins, you can also visit our logins page . Facebook Twitter Instagram YouTube Academics Tuition and Fin